      "description": "The vent floods the flats with magma every 34 seconds, for 22 seconds at a time; the pad, mesa and relay stay dry. A dry spell of 12 seconds is too short to cross the 48-cell flats at a Marine's walk (about 15 s), so the Sergeant has to wait out a surge on the mesa.",
